# Database migrations

This project did not previously have a migration workflow. Flask-Migrate/Alembic
is now configured for versioned schema changes; application startup does not
apply migrations automatically.

After reviewing the migration and backing up the configured database, apply it
manually from `Server/`:

```sh
flask --app main:app db upgrade
```

The task-tracking migration only adds nullable columns to `trip`. Its downgrade
removes only those newly added columns. Do not downgrade after task metadata has
been written unless that metadata loss is acceptable and explicitly approved.
